<Slide style={{ background: '#0B1020', padding: 60 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>项目概述</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>01 / 是什么</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: 'rgba(34,211,238,0.4)', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, marginTop: 28, height: 470 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 470, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>
                    把随手记的碎片
                    <br />
                    变成<span style={{ color: '#22D3EE' }}>能找到</span>的日程与知识
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 20 }}>
                    它先把"一段话"变成结构化的日程条目，再让你用三种方式把它找回来；
                    顺带把你常看的几个网站聚合成一条信息流，并且能按意思搜到正文。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ gap: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#4F46E5' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>录入：一段自然语 → 结构化条目（可人工确认）</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#22D3EE' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>检索：全文 / 语义 / 问答，三种都能搜信息流</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#F0ABFC' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>形态：桌面 + 网页 + 手机 PWA，数据在你自己设备上</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 650, position: 'relative' }}>
            <Image src="assets/today.png" style={{ width: 400, height: 250, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #334155' }} />
            <Image src="assets/calendar.png" style={{ width: 300, height: 188, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #334155', position: 'absolute', right: 0, top: 150 }} />
            <Image src="assets/graph.png" style={{ width: 220, height: 138, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #334155', position: 'absolute', left: 20, top: 300 }} />
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, marginTop: 16, padding: 16, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>一句话</span>
            ：没有账号、没有服务器、默认不联网 —— AI 与同步都是你自己决定要不要开的开关。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 670 }}>个人工作台 · v0.2.0</Text>
</Slide>
